3.3.evidence:
complaint services;
The Regional Government is obliged to provide a complaint service unit for the protection of women and children victims of violence.
Paragraph (1) Point a What is meant by complaint services is a series of actions carried out by the organizers of integrated service institutions to follow up on reports of acts of violence against women and children submitted by victims, families and/or the community.

3.3.evidence_original:
pelayanan pengaduan;

Pemerintah Daerah wajib menyediakan unit pelayanan pengaduan  perlindungan perempuan dan anak korban kekerasan.

Ayat (1) Huruf a Yang dimaksud dengan pelayanan pengaduan adalah serangkaian tindakan yang dilakukan oleh penyelenggara  lembaga layanan terpadu untukm menindaklanjuti laporan adanya tindak kekerasan terhadap perempuan  dan anak yang diajukan korban, keluarga dan/atau  masyarakat.
